\section{What is different}{

Node size is by area, not by diameter. Labels carry the sample size on a
second line. The plot is a \code{ggplot}, so it composes with other ggplot
layers and saves through \verb{file =} in one call instead of \code{png()} /
\code{dev.off()} pairs.
